# Normalise every tracked file to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# The generated documents this project emits are LF-pinned (docs/output.md) and
# the insta snapshots that hold them are LF too (docs/development.md), so a
# Windows working tree must not rewrite any file to CRLF. `text=auto` still
# detects and leaves binary files (e.g. tests/fixtures/**/*.png) untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
